  "description": "<p>DateTimeUtil does allocate 1 SimpleDateFormat object at least for each datastream/version. Since SimpleDateFormat is not thread-safe as pointed out by Ben this could be done via a ThreadLocal&lt;&gt; rather than a static object reference. I'll check into that and maybe try out other formatter as well.</p>",
